    {
      "id": "evt_gcal_com_verci_0635a7d9",
      "name": "Clothing Swap",
      "type": "technology",
      "locationId": "",
      "communityId": "com_verci",
      "description": "Clothing swap! Bring clothes and accessories you\u2019re done with, and find something new-to-you.\nSunday, Nov 15 \u00b7 1\u20133pm\nVerci, 45 E 20th Street, Floor 12\nHow it works\nSelling something? Tag it with a paper slip that has your price and Venmo. Buyers pay you directly.\nGiving something away? Put it in the free section. Take whatever you like from it.\nAnything left at the end gets donated.\nMaterials are provided.\nBring a tote, bring a friend, and come hang out. See you there!\nHosted by Verci & Object Theory",
